---
/**
 * PWA <head> tags shared by every page shell. Pulled out of BaseLayout so
 * CourseLayout (the installed-app shell once someone owns a course) can't
 * silently drift out of sync with it — one manifest/icon set for the whole
 * origin, declared once.
 *
 * theme-color is deliberately NOT here: BaseLayout and CourseLayout each
 * paint their own top bar and want the OS status bar to match, so that meta
 * tag stays per-layout.
 */
---

<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/apple-touch-icon.png" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Yin Yoga" />
